</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Inscribed upon the Cross we see</l><l>In shining letters, God is love!</l><l>He bears our sins upon the tree,</l><l>He brings us mercy from above.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>The Cross: it takes our guilt away;</l><l>It holds the fainting spirit up;</l><l>It cheers with hope the gloomy day,</l><l>And sweetens every bitter cup.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>The balm of life, the cure of woe,</l><l>The measure and the pledge of love,</l><l>The sinner’s refuge here below,</l><l>The angels’ theme in heav’n above.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
